WEBVTT

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:43.260
Let's do it.

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:46.440
Three! Two! One!

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:48.500
Go, Shoot!

00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:53.200
Go, Uriel!

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:54.850
Dranzer!

00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:57.940
Uriel!

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:01.640
What?!

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:03.860
He blew him back!

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:08.620
I won't lose!

00:02:09.320 --> 00:02:11.370
Uriel!

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:23.000
Suzaku!

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:29.420
A Sacred Beast?

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:36.130
Go!

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:37.630
Uriel!

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:40.570
Dranzer!

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:49.970
He's good!

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:51.860
Dranzer!

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:57.180
Uriel!

00:02:58.480 --> 00:02:59.740
You're finished!

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:01.300
No he's not!

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:05.220
Gabriel!!

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:19.100
Suzaku!

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:20.640
--Go!

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:32.730
Takao and the team are ready for the
world championships with their pairs set.

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:38.740
During which, Kai was challenged by the parts hunters, King and Queen.

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:41.010
And they broke Dranzer!

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:42.410
--What?!

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:45.700
--Double Attack!

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:54.330
Suzaku!

00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:03.720
More enemies have
arrived to challenge us.

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:25.300
Good morning!

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:29.350
Where is Kai?

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:31.310
He was here earlier...

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:35.860
Isn't he out somewhere with Rei
doing some sorta secret training?

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:39.610
Since the two of
them are partners.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:41.040
That's right.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:48.140
Don't the matchups for the first round of
the F and G blocks get announced today?

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:49.630
They do!

00:04:56.280 --> 00:04:57.840
It's finally our turn.

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:02.350
The other blocks are about
to start their final rounds.

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:05.120
And others are about
to wrap up entirely.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:07.220
Really, then!
All right, Max!

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:09.050
Let's get to practicing!

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:10.170
Okay!

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:16.170
Go, Shoot!

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:26.150
They're good partners!
Completely synchronized!

00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:32.830
Who's there?!

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:33.830
Show yourselves!

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:40.760
Kane!

00:05:40.760 --> 00:05:41.930
Jim!

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:44.460
Good to see you
again, Kinomiya.

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:46.830
Don't surprise
me like that!

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:48.680
When did you
return to Japan?

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:52.120
The day before the
B block finals started.

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:53.450
That must mean...

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:57.220
We came to Japan
to play in the finals.

00:05:57.220 --> 00:05:58.530
So that's what it is!

00:05:58.530 --> 00:06:01.370
How did you guys do?

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:04.580
Tomorrow will be the
battle to choose the reps.

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:06.810
You did it!

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:10.390
Do your best tomorrow
and be sure to win!

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:12.490
We'll come and
root for you!

00:06:13.110 --> 00:06:14.410
Kane!

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:16.210
Hey!

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:21.470
Kane and Jim are going to battle
in the B block finals tomorrow.

00:06:21.470 --> 00:06:22.770
Really?

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:25.010
Where are Salima and Goki?

00:06:25.430 --> 00:06:29.630
They're continuing
their Beyblade training,

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:34.460
so they're in Salima's home country of
Canada, teaching kids how to Beyblade.

00:06:37.550 --> 00:06:38.830
Wow!

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:42.550
Work your hardest
for them, too!

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:43.700
We will.

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:46.170
We'll be sure
to win tomorrow.

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:48.570
The same goes for
you two as well!

00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:50.860
Don't disappoint
Kane and Jim!

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:53.150
You don't
have to tell me!

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:54.150
Right?

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:56.970
By the way, Kai.

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:01.530
Here. This is Dranzer V2.

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:04.940
The axis has been
further improved.

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:07.300
Of course its attack
power has increased,

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:10.840
but it can shift to defense
using its quick movements.

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:14.120
Basically, it can switch from attack to defense in the midst of battle.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:18.700
And then mode change
back to attack on the fly.

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:22.120
Give it a test run.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:42.330
Whoa!

00:07:44.920 --> 00:07:49.950
Once you customize it with the Magnecore
and the Magne Weight Disk, it'll be complete.

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:56.770
Here.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.940
There's nothing even
remotely useful in here.

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:39.620
I finally found you.
King and Queen.

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:49.700
The four Sacred Beasts?

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:53.730
None of that stuff has
anything to do with us.

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:55.050
You said it!

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:58.750
Once you understand how
powerful the four Sacred Beasts are,

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:01.660
you won't be
laughing for long.

00:09:01.660 --> 00:09:02.910
What?!

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:06.790
If you had the power of
the four Sacred Beasts,

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:11.000
you could get your hands
on whatever parts you like.

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:15.120
If we wanted the four Sacred Beasts, we'd just take them ourselves.

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:18.940
I don't see any
reason to join you.

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:25.990
Can you two transfer the power of the
four Sacred Beasts into your Beyblades?

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:29.190
I can do that.

00:09:29.510 --> 00:09:34.300
The Bladers with the four Sacred Beasts will be in the world championships.

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:36.980
You two will
enter as well.

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:40.030
I'll handle the paperwork
for your entries.

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:41.600
Hold on a second.

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:44.390
Who said we'd be
entering that tournament?

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:48.800
Don't you want the power
of the four Sacred Beasts?

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:52.990
Don't you want to
improve your Beys?

00:09:52.990 --> 00:09:56.140
You don't need to
worry about that.

00:09:58.310 --> 00:10:01.070
We've done everything together.

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:02.750
Always have, always will.

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:05.200
Walking hand-in-hand
with people off the street?

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:07.830
That stuff cramps our style.

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.530
King and Queen...

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:20.650
I'm not giving up.

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:26.800
I won't let Zagart have the four
Sacred Beasts without a fight.

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:50.340
This is Gordo, your partner
for the world championships.

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:57.190
Gordo, this is your Bey.

00:10:57.190 --> 00:10:58.560
Orthros.

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:05.110
May I try it out?

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:07.510
Battle him, Zeo.

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:28.230
--Three! Two! One!

00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:30.350
--Go, Shoot!

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:38.230
Rise, Orthros!

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:51.560
Cerberus!

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:03.040
The two of you must obtain the
four Sacred Beasts, no matter what!

00:12:18.310 --> 00:12:19.700
You've got this, Kane!

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:20.910
Kane!

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:22.340
Go!

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:26.720
He's out!
Blown right back!

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:31.430
Stadium Out!

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:33.170
Kane is the winner!

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:39.070
Kane and Jim have made
it to the final rounds!

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:47.340
I'm glad you won!

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:51.290
Both of you won handily, so
there was no risk of losing!

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:53.890
It's all because you
guys were there for us!

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:54.870
Yeah.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:56.170
Help!

00:12:58.350 --> 00:12:59.530
Someone help!

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:01.210
What happened?

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:03.030
My friend...

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:05.930
Was attacked by
a pair of Bladers...

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:08.050
A pair of Bladers?

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:11.010
They said they
were parts hunters!

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:14.090
King and Queen...

00:13:15.650 --> 00:13:16.770
Kai?

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:19.070
Where were they attacked?

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:22.030
A park in the mountains
that's just ahead.

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:24.660
Kai!

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:36.460
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:54.460
Stop!

00:14:01.560 --> 00:14:02.670
Stop this!

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:05.120
That's enough.

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:06.530
I remember you.

00:14:10.270 --> 00:14:13.370
You're the guy whose
Beyblade we broke.

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:16.970
That's right. I'm here
for my revenge.

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:23.440
Is that a new Beyblade? Looks like it's improved quite a bit.

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:27.300
You haven't learned your lesson if
you came all this way to lose again.

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:31.650
I won't let you get away
with what you've done!

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:36.640
We won't get away
with it, he says!

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:38.050
I'm so scared!

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:40.300
I'll fight you.

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:48.860
Let's get started!

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:52.040
Three! Two! One!

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:53.760
Go, Shoot!

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:18.620
I'm going to take that Attack
Ring of yours this time!

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:19.960
No, you won't!

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:26.430
Dranzer!

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:32.300
It's more powerful
than before...

00:15:35.670 --> 00:15:37.820
Uriel!!

00:15:50.690 --> 00:15:52.510
Suzaku!!

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:04.220
King!

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:12.910
Come on!

00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:29.810
Kai!

00:16:30.610 --> 00:16:33.010
Stay out of this!
This is my battle!

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:37.410
Those are the shady black
market parts hunters!

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:38.730
King and Queen...

00:16:38.730 --> 00:16:42.770
Kai won't stop until
he gets his revenge!

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:49.120
Wow!

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:52.940
When it comes to
attack and defense,

00:16:52.940 --> 00:16:55.200
his Sacred Beast and
Bey are quite powerful!

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:57.200
Kai..

00:17:11.490 --> 00:17:12.960
Dranzer!

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:16.690
Keep it up, King!
Keep attacking!

00:17:16.690 --> 00:17:18.650
I'll put you in your place!

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:26.760
Kai!

00:17:27.170 --> 00:17:31.610
Don't lose to some
parts thief like this guy!

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:34.220
Dranzer!!

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.290
Whoa!

00:17:48.470 --> 00:17:50.660
Suzaku!

00:17:55.170 --> 00:18:06.070
Uriel!

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:07.310
Suzaku!

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:15.560
They're both too strong!

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:33.840
Heads up!

00:18:37.150 --> 00:18:38.210
Kai!

00:18:41.820 --> 00:18:43.300
Are you all right, Kai?

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:44.410
Yeah.

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.800
King and Queen are gone...

00:19:02.770 --> 00:19:05.290
You'll have to save
your revenge for later.

00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:12.980
Kai...

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:23.350
How do you feel after fighting
one of the four Sacred Beasts?

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:26.530
What? That Sacred
Beast just now...

00:19:26.530 --> 00:19:27.820
That was one of them?

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:31.520
Yes. One of the four
Sacred Beasts, Suzaku.

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:33.810
So that was one...

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:35.590
There are three more!

00:19:36.020 --> 00:19:41.390
Seiryu. Byakko. Genbu. They're all Sacred
Beasts that are just as powerful as Suzaku.

00:19:53.070 --> 00:19:58.700
The crowd's getting hyped to
see last year's champions battle!

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:04.260
You can do it, Takao!

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:05.390
Go for it!

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:10.880
Max from the Kinomiya/Mizuhara
team wins and passes the baton!

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:16.470
If Kinomiya wins, then the two
of them move on to round two!

00:20:16.760 --> 00:20:18.180
Let's do it!

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:20.550
Go, Shoot!

00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:32.390
Takao Kinomiya
is the winner!

00:20:42.950 --> 00:20:45.490
Kinomiya. Max.
Congratulations.

00:20:45.850 --> 00:20:46.700
Yeah!

00:20:46.700 --> 00:20:47.850
Thank you.

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:50.850
Kai and Rei are up next!

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:51.740
Yup.

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:54.000
What is it?

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:57.460
King and Queen have
entered the tournament!

00:20:57.460 --> 00:20:58.460
What?!

00:20:59.990 --> 00:21:03.670
They're the shady
parts hunters, right?

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:07.030
I thought they weren't
interested in official tournaments!

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:10.540
What are they after?

00:21:17.280 --> 00:21:22.850
It's gonna be rough for us this year
unless we really step up our game.

00:22:59.450 --> 00:23:04.480
The team learns of a shocking truth about Zeo from Zagart!

00:23:04.480 --> 00:23:08.820
And then things get crazy at a pre-
tournament press conference!

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:10.610
Doesn't that get your
heart pumping, Chairman?

00:23:10.610 --> 00:23:14.440
What? Just like when
you take the stairs?

00:23:14.440 --> 00:23:16.580
You need more exercise!

00:23:16.580 --> 00:23:19.120
Make sure you do
your Beyblade exercises!

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:22.220
Don't forget to watch
the next episode!
